{"name":"Bloody Pico-8","hex":"#ff004d","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"bloody","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Covered in blood.","Characterised by bloodshed."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["Used to express anger, annoyance, or shock, or for emphasis."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bloody"},{"term":"pico","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Ellipsis of pico de gallo."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pico"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bloody","blocks":[{"text":"Bloody, as an adjective or adverb, is an expletive attributive commonly used in British, Irish, Australian and New Zealand English. It is also used in Canada, India, Hawaii, Kenya, Malaysia, New Caledonia, Singapore, South Africa, Zimbabwe and a number of other Commonwealth nations. It has been used as an intensive since at least the 1670s."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bloody","wikidata":"Q4928046"},{"title":"PICO-8","blocks":[{"text":"PICO-8 is a virtual machine and game engine created by Lexaloffle Games. It is a fantasy video game console that mimics the limited audio-visual capabilities of 8-bit systems from the 1980s to encourage creativity and ingenuity in producing games without being overwhelmed with the many possibilities of modern tools and machines. Such limitations also give PICO-8 games a particular look and feel."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Pico-8-boot.gif/330px-Pico-8-boot.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PICO-8","wikidata":"Q28456260"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Pico-8_default_and_hidden_palette.png/330px-Pico-8_default_and_hidden_palette.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Pico-8_default_and_hidden_palette.png/330px-Pico-